    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/aa/Screenshot_20240622_090355_Chrome.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240622143221\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Screenshot 20240622 090355 Chrome\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/aa/Screenshot_20240622_090355_Chrome.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240622143221\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1004\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Screenshot 20240622 090355 Chrome.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Screenshot_20240622_090355_Chrome.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eDaring Master Samurai\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eSen Tokugawa\u003c/b\u003e is a character from the  series.\n\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyakka_Ry%C5%8Dran_Samurai_Girls\"\u003eHyakka Ryouran: Samurai Girls\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eMuneakira Yagyū\u0027\u003c/b\u003es childhood friend and the eldest daughter of the Tokugawa Shogunate. She seems to have feelings for Muneakira, and acts very much like a tsundere towards him. She is a self-proclaimed spoiled princess and always seeks to get her way regarding any decision she wants to make. She gets extremely jealous of any girl who tries to get close to Muneakira, and generally acts upon this jealousy by flying into a rage, like when \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Akane_%27Jubei%27_Yagyu\" title=\"Akane \u0026#39;Jubei\u0026#39; Yagyu\"\u003eAkane \u0027Jubei\u0027 Yagyu\u003c/a\u003e kissed him in front of her and she later had him wear a full oni helmet so he could \"reflect\" on the kiss he shared with \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Yukimura_Sanada\" title=\"Yukimura Sanada\"\u003eYukimura Sanada\u003c/a\u003e. Later, she reveals her true feelings to Muneakira and kisses him, thus becoming his third Master Samurai. Her weapon is a naginata decorated near the blade and her transformation phrase is Tenga Ryūrei which means \"Elegant Beauty\", and Samurai Master badge is \"Elegance\".\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn the second season she is able to transform into a Master Samurai at will with no phrase required. Sen\u0027s attacks usually involve thunderor lightning\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/b/b8/Tokugawa_Sen_Daring_Master_Samurai_Bride_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250320030630\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Tokugawa Sen Daring Master Samurai Bride Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/b/b8/Tokugawa_Sen_Daring_Master_Samurai_Bride_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250320030630\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1016\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Tokugawa Sen Daring Master Samurai Bride Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Tokugawa_Sen_Daring_Master_Samurai_Bride_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/16/Sen_Tokugawa_S_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_Samurai_Bride_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240622143425\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Sen Tokugawa S QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran Samurai Bride \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/16/Sen_Tokugawa_S_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_Samurai_Bride_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240622143425\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1017\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Sen Tokugawa S QBULB × Hyakka Ryouran Samurai Bride .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Sen_Tokugawa_S_QBULB_%C3%97_Hyakka_Ryouran_Samurai_Bride_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820194058\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n--\u003e\n\u003c!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n--\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39720-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260820194058 and revision id 64426. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n --\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e"
